<title>UK: SOCCER-UEFA CUP THIRD ROUND FIRST LEG RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UEFA CUP THIRD ROUND FIRST LEG RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of UEFA Cup third round first leg matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>In Brugge:</p>
<p>Club Brugge (Belgium) 2 Schalke Germany) 1</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Club Brugge - Mario Stanic 35, Robert Spehar 58</p>
<p>Schalke - Michael Bueskens 50  </p>
<p>In Monaco:</p>
<p>Monaco (France) 3 Hamburg (Germany) 0 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Sonny Anderson 48, Victor Ikpeba 70, Patrick Blondeau 76</p>
<p>Attendance: 11,000  </p>
<p>In Helsingborg:</p>
<p>Helsingborg (Sweden) 0 Anderlecht (Belgium) 0</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,304  </p>
<p>In Valencia:</p>
<p>Valencia (Spain) 3 Besiktas (Turkey) 1 (2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Valencia - Goran Vlaovic 17, Ali Guncar own goal 23, Francisco Ferreira 82.</p>
<p>Besiktas - Oktay Derelioglu 33  </p>
<p>In Tenerife:</p>
<p>Tenerife (Spain) 0 Feyenoord (Netherlands) 0</p>
<p>Attendance: 19,000</p>
</text>
